    "contentReview": "FabControlBook v1.1.0 reconstructs all 14 English/Korean chapter pairs and four interactive synthetic labs. Independent internal Sol High scientific/numerical and bilingual reviews checked the controller recurrence, distinct metrology/actuation delays, SPC/FDC/alarm populations and denominators, units, worked cases, and source limits; targeted QA, requirements, documentation, security/provenance, and release reviews closed actionable P0/P1/P2 findings. The finite-horizon Monte Carlo results are not ARL estimates; the stated R2R convergence condition applies only to the documented unsaturated, noise-free, memoryless special case. Models are educational, synthetic, and uncalibrated to a production fab or silicon. No external professional, human translation, contributor-rights, or legal certification is claimed. See the v1.1.0 release notes and source docs/RECONSTRUCTION_CANDIDATE.md, docs/MODELS_AND_VALIDATION.md, and docs/PROVENANCE_AND_REVIEW.md.",
